      "writtenOn": "2021-06-11T16:56:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you leave out the CONFIG_ prefix inside Kconfig.\n\nAlso, would we ever want to have CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_MPU\u003dn and CONFIG_MPU\u003dy? I can\u0027t think of a reason for this. I would move MPU to a `select MPU` so we can just set `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_MPU\u003dy` and CONFIG_MPU would automatically be selected.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 423,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 423,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "fef3931fc89ecec8c5b629a45228c04c4902ac2e",
